                                        "entry_id": "c3cd6eec-3e8b-3503-9618-cc9490f48ad4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A government run by idiots."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "humorous",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1e888b5-24c9-40ac-a1d4-2d34576c5e98",
                                                "sense_id": "2e6d23a3-fbda-3cbf-b11b-1a41eb9b9798",
                                                "text": "In trying to explain why our political paralysis seems to have gotten so much worse over the past year, analysts have rounded up a plausible collection of reasons including: President Obama's tactical missteps, the obstinacy of congressional Republicans, rising partisanship in Washington, the blustering idiocracy of the cable-news stations, and the Senate filibuster, which has devolved into a super-majority threshold for any important legislation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
